{
  "name": "VeyCall: new lead to Google Sheets",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "291e55a9-de52-5747-85c9-ae8f4bd7c112",
      "name": "Setup",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -480,
        -300
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## VeyCall: new lead to Google Sheets\n\nEvery lead your agent captures (calls, website, WhatsApp, email…) is added as a row.\n\n1. **VeyCall Trigger**: your *VeyCall API* credential. Activating the workflow subscribes it in VeyCall; deactivating unsubscribes.\n2. **Add the lead**: connect Google Sheets and pick a sheet with the columns *Date, Name, Phone, Email, Need, Priority, Status, Agent, Link*.\n3. Activate.",
        "width": 500,
        "height": 380,
        "color": 4
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "5a4cc45d-3ea2-521b-86f5-1adbf67ab626",
      "name": "New lead",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-veycall.veyCallTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        0,
        0
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "events": [
          "lead.created"
        ],
        "urgentOnly": false
      },
      "webhookId": "veycall-new-lead"
    },
    {
      "id": "6df8f34e-0bf2-5779-9c73-eec2a8fdfb60",
      "name": "Add the lead",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.googleSheets",
      "typeVersion": 4.5,
      "position": [
        260,
        0
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "operation": "append",
        "documentId": {
          "__rl": true,
          "mode": "list",
          "value": ""
        },
        "sheetName": {
          "__rl": true,
          "mode": "list",
          "value": ""
        },
        "columns": {
          "mappingMode": "defineBelow",
          "value": {
            "Date": "={{ $json.data.created_at }}",
            "Name": "={{ $json.data.name ?? '' }}",
            "Phone": "={{ $json.data.phone ?? '' }}",
            "Email": "={{ $json.data.email ?? '' }}",
            "Need": "={{ $json.data.notes ?? '' }}",
            "Priority": "={{ $json.data.priority }}",
            "Status": "={{ $json.data.status }}",
            "Agent": "={{ $json.data.agent?.name ?? '' }}",
            "Link": "={{ $json.data.url }}"
          },
